    ("notfound-neutral", "NotFound is lack of covering evidence", "NotFound means no covering authorization in the locally available validated set; it is not proof that the route is malicious or legitimate, and policy must handle that uncertainty explicitly.", "rov-notfound"),
    ("ecmp-flow-stability", "Stable ECMP has fixed-input assumptions", "Flow affinity depends on selected header fields, stable group membership, and stable hash mapping; fragmented packets may lack transport fields, and membership changes can remap flows.", "flow-affinity"),
